Author: Robert Frohl <rfrohl@suse.com>
Date: Thu Aug 13 10:47:01 2026 +0200

Make building virtualbox-kmp-longterm possible again
under openSUSE with kernel-longterm >= 6.18.44.

References: https://github.com/VirtualBox/virtualbox/issues/812

diff --git a/src/VBox/Additions/linux/drm/vbox_fb.c b/src/VBox/Additions/linux/drm/vbox_fb.c
index 16970bed2ee..3850be24cf9 100644
--- a/src/VBox/Additions/linux/drm/vbox_fb.c
+++ b/src/VBox/Additions/linux/drm/vbox_fb.c
@@ -335,7 +335,7 @@ int vboxfb_create(struct drm_fb_helper *helper,
 		return ret;
 	}
 
-#if RTLNX_VER_MIN(6,19,0) || RTLNX_RHEL_RANGE(9,9, 9,99)
+#if RTLNX_VER_MIN(6,18,44) || RTLNX_RHEL_RANGE(9,9, 9,99)
 	info = helper->info;
 #elif RTLNX_VER_MIN(6,2,0) || RTLNX_RHEL_RANGE(8,9, 8,99) || RTLNX_RHEL_RANGE(9,3, 9,99)
 	info = drm_fb_helper_alloc_info(helper);
